						<div class="encabezado"><h2>La Giralda</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14225 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/3-giralda.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/3-giralda-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/3-giralda.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14225 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/3-giralda.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/3-giralda.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/3-giralda-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Torre campanario de la Catedral y símbolo indiscutible de Sevilla. Sobre ella el Giraldillo, escultura que representa el triunfo de la Fe.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-a4974ce e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

