																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado">
<h2>El Coro</h2>
<div class="fecha"></div>
</div>
<img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14226 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/5-coro.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/5-coro-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/5-coro.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14226 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/5-coro.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/5-coro.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/5-coro-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript>
<div class="texto">Ubicado en la zona del Crucero justo al frente de la Capilla Mayor. Alberga el imponente y majestuoso órgano.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-7c80d99 e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Sala Capitular</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14228 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/6-sala-capitular.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/6-sala-capitular-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/6-sala-capitular.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14228 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/6-sala-capitular.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/6-sala-capitular.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/6-sala-capitular-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Uno de los recintos más admirables de la arquitectura española del renacimiento. Acoge una magnífica serie de obras de Murillo encargadas al pintor en 1667.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-07e0292 e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Sacristía Mayor</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14229 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/7-sacristia-mayor.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/7-sacristia-mayor-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/7-sacristia-mayor.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14229 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/7-sacristia-mayor.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/7-sacristia-mayor.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/7-sacristia-mayor-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Construcción renacentista realizada en el siglo XVI y la sacristía principal de la Catedral. En su cúpula se representa el Juicio Final.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-5adef3c e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Capilla de San Andrés</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14233 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/8-capilla-san-andres.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/8-capilla-san-andres-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/8-capilla-san-andres.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14233 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/8-capilla-san-andres.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/8-capilla-san-andres.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/8-capilla-san-andres-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Lugar para la oración y para visualizar en silencio una de las mayores obras del arte sacro universal, el Cristo de la Clemencia.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-9780b3f e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Cristóbal Colón</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14234 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/9-cristobal-colon.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/9-cristobal-colon-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/9-cristobal-colon.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14234 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/9-cristobal-colon.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/9-cristobal-colon.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/9-cristobal-colon-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Se encuentra en la Catedral desde 1899. El grupo escultórico se concibió como una procesión fúnebre con cuatro heraldos.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-8e251a6 e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Capilla de la Virgen de la Antigua</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14236 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/10-virgen-de-la-antigua.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/10-virgen-de-la-antigua-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/10-virgen-de-la-antigua.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14236 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/10-virgen-de-la-antigua.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/10-virgen-de-la-antigua.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/10-virgen-de-la-antigua-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Junto a la Capilla Real, la más importante de la Catedral. Preside una representación de la Virgen de la Antigua de finales del siglo XIV.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-5bf66c1 e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Capilla de San Antonio</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14240 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/11-capilla-san-antonio.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/11-capilla-san-antonio-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/11-capilla-san-antonio.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14240 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/11-capilla-san-antonio.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/11-capilla-san-antonio.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/11-capilla-san-antonio-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">A mediados del siglo XVII se convierte en capilla bautismal. Destacan la gran pila central renacentista y dos importantes pinturas de Murillo.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						<div class="e-hotspot elementor-repeater-item-29dae61 e-hotspot--sequenced e-hotspot--position-left e-hotspot--position-top   e-hotspot--icon">

								<div class="e-hotspot__button e-hotspot--expand">
																		<div class="e-hotspot__icon"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i></div>
																					</div>

																		<div class="e-hotspot__tooltip  e-hotspot--tooltip-position e-hotspot--fade-in-out " >
						<div class="encabezado"><h2>Altar del Jubileo</h2><div class="fecha"> </div></div><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14241 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20500%20310'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="500" height="310" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/12-altar-jubileo.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/12-altar-jubileo-300x186.jpg 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" data-lazy-src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/12-altar-jubileo.jpg" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-14241 size-full" src="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/12-altar-jubileo.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="310" srcset="https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/12-altar-jubileo.jpg 500w, https://www.catedraldesevilla.es/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/12-altar-jubileo-300x186.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></p><div class="texto">Colosal altar eucarístico en plata de finales del siglo XVII que se usaba para celebraciones litúrgicas extraordinarias al Santísimo Sacramento.</div>					</div>
									
			</div>

	
						</div>
				</div>
