 7.87538ZM22.111 24.4542C22.111 24.4542 22.2978 24.4429 22.6175 24.4542L22.8345 24.4606C25.1022 24.5756 27.4239 25.3762 29.0367 27.0605C28.4622 28.7512 27.3511 30.4377 25.9531 31.8008C20.7437 31.2813 19.2491 24.4556 19.2491 24.4556L22.111 24.4542ZM10.8113 24.4542H10.9575H13.2274C13.2274 24.4542 11.8315 30.8288 7.03352 31.731C5.69707 30.4377 4.6419 28.8522 4.03245 27.0605C5.64879 25.3698 8.44624 24.3582 10.8113 24.4542Z" fill="white"></path></svg>			</div>
